WEBVTT

00:02:28.403 --> 00:02:32.977
And I'm here to tell you
that nanoparticles are the fire trucks.

00:02:33.323 --> 00:02:37.405
We can load cancer drugs
inside nanoparticles,

00:02:37.429 --> 00:02:41.079
and nanoparticles
can function as the carrier

00:02:41.103 --> 00:02:42.984
and necessary equipment

00:02:43.008 --> 00:02:46.761
to bring the cancer drugs
to the heart of the tumor.

00:02:48.315 --> 00:02:49.817
So what are nanoparticles,

00:02:49.841 --> 00:02:52.608
and what does it really mean
to be nano-sized?

00:02:53.664 --> 00:02:57.037
Well, there are many different
types of nanoparticles

00:02:57.061 --> 00:02:58.736
made out of various materials,

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.133
such as metal-based nanoparticles